  <summary>Skin plugin for OpenRGB that customizes the OpenRGB look and feel</summary>

  <description>
    <p>
      The OpenRGB Skin Plugin is a plugin for OpenRGB that allows customizing
      the look and feel of OpenRGB with custom skins.  Skins are Qt stylesheet
      files that change the colors, fonts, and controls of the OpenRGB user
      interface.
    </p><p>
      Features
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>Apply skins from the skins folder</li>
      <li>Load skins from disk</li>
      <li>Load the current skin automatically at startup</li>
    </ul>
  </description>

